{"source": "script:feeling", "raw": "[thinking|speaker] {sigh 0.6} Honestly? A little tired. {look_at:audience 0.5} Every week there's a new model, a new agent, a new robot. {nod 0.6} Some days it feels like a sci-fi movie, and not the fun kind.", "valid": true, "t_total": 0.0002268439857289195}
