{"source": "script:respect", "raw": "[happy|audience] {look_around 0.7} Okay, fair enough. They are a very cheerful bunch. {head_bob 0.7} Respect accepted, my friend!", "valid": true, "t_total": 0.00016061202040873468}
{"source": "script:steve_brain", "raw": "[excited|speaker] {head_bob 0.6} Hi, Steve! {look_at:laptop 0.6} Google's Gemma four, the E four B model, right here on this MacBook. {laugh 0.4} You gave it a LoRA, and now it thinks it's a frog.", "valid": true, "t_total": 0.00015572199481539428}
{"source": "script:steve_ears", "raw": "[happy|speaker] {lean_in 0.6} Parakeet turns your voice into words, Gemma does the thinking, and Kokoro gives me this lovely voice. {nod 0.6} I speak sentence by sentence, so I start in well under a second.", "valid": true, "t_total": 0.002463487006025389}
{"source": "script:steve_gestures", "raw": "[thinking|speaker] {tilt_right 0.5} I write little gesture tags right into my sentences. {nod 0.8} Like this nod. {surprise 0.9} Whoa, and that one! {look_at:speaker 0.5} The xArm performs them on the exact word.", "valid": true, "t_total": 0.00020629301434382796}
{"source": "script:steve_robotics", "raw": "[excited|audience] {flail 0.8} Because brains like mine now fit on a laptop! {look_at:audience 0.6} Small smart models, good cameras, and arms that can move. {nod 0.7} Robots are about to get a lot friendlier.", "valid": true, "t_total": 0.00020639199647121131}
{"source": "script:handoff", "raw": "[excited|audience] {nod 0.8} Absolutely! {look_around 0.7} Judges, hit me with your questions. {lean_in 0.6} I promise I only bite flies.", "valid": true, "t_total": 0.0001565819839015603}
{"t_first_token": 0.24626667398842983, "t_header": 0.32150404498679563, "t_first_sentence": 0.55082325800322, "source": "llm", "raw": "[happy|speaker] {laugh 0.4} The arm just follows my words! {nod 0.5} I write the gesture tags right before the words. {shrug 0.4} If I don't write one, it stays still.", "t_total": 1.1821489100111648, "valid": true}
{"t_first_token": 0.23377426699153148, "t_header": 0.3070042209874373, "t_first_sentence": 0.7736433949903585, "source": "llm", "raw": "[happy|speaker] {shake 0.6} No cloud, no internet, {nod 0.5} so it's private and works anywhere. {head_bob 0.5} And the hackathon requires it. Plus, it's more fun to chat with a frog.", "t_total": 1.2777499319927301, "valid": true}
